/*
 * A big gust of wind can try to push you off of the pier. Whitney and the npc fisher can try to save you.
 */

:: Fishing Pier Wind
A violent gust of wind slams into you and knocks you off your feet, and despite your attempts to stay upright <span class="red">you're thrown into the water.</span>
<br><br>

<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
<<run stopFishingProp()>>
<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>




:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Idle
A violent gust of wind slams into you and knocks off your feet. Just as you are about to go over the edge, Whitney catches your wrist.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Whitney.love gte 20 or random(1, 2) is 1>>
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> laughs, "careful, slut. Can't have you drowning on me." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls you back toward the railing with a smirk.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> seems to consider for a moment, then <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip loosens. "Oops," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, and lets go. <<gstress>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="red">You go over the edge, plunging into the water below the pier.</span> Above you, you can hear Whitney's friends laughing.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Bet
A violent gust of wind slams into you and knocks you off your feet, and despite your attempts to stay upright <span class="red">you're thrown into the water.</span> You hear Whitney's friends burst out laughing as you go over.
<br><br>

<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
<<run stopFishingProp()>>
<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Fisher
<<if random(1, 2) is 1>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	A violent gust of wind slams into you and knocks you off your feet, but before you fall into the water, the <<person1>><<person>> drops <<his>> fishing rod and lunges towards you, grabbing your arm and pulling you back. <<stress 5>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>

	"You okay?" <<he>> asks, breathing hard.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Fisher Thank Normal]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Thank <<him>> with a kiss|Fishing Pier Fisher Thank Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><</link>>
<<else>>
	A violent gust of wind slams into you and knocks you off your feet, and despite your attempts to stay upright <span class="red">you're thrown into the water.</span>. <<stress 5>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>













